Firmware licensing scope
========================

SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Copyright 2026 26-EngBot contributors.

Unless a file or component says otherwise, original firmware contributions
created for the 26-EngBot project are licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The full text is available at:

    ../LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt

This grant applies only to contributions for which the named contributors
hold the necessary rights. It does not relicense:

- STM32CubeMX-generated or STMicroelectronics-provided code;
- CMSIS and CMSIS-DSP components supplied by Arm or STMicroelectronics;
- FreeRTOS, SEGGER RTT, or any other third-party middleware;
- files carrying an existing copyright or license notice, including files
  marked "HNU YueLu EC ... all rights reserved";
- datasheets, protocol manuals, images, prebuilt libraries, or other vendor
  documentation; or
- material whose provenance or licensing authority has not been established.

The main third-party locations include Drivers/, Middlewares/, and files with
their own headers elsewhere in the firmware tree. Those components remain
subject to their original notices and bundled license files. If a file-level
notice conflicts with this directory notice, the file-level notice controls.
